                        "sense_id": "87e9961c-cc21-3bb2-b496-867ba14c1c8a",
                        "entry_id": "7b328a00-7936-322d-8f4a-7d8f26a933da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The author of anarchy; one who excites revolt."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "07ec7264-8c39-4176-8bd8-aa315a9a7f96",
                                "sense_id": "87e9961c-cc21-3bb2-b496-867ba14c1c8a",
                                "text": "Thus Satan; and him thus the Anarch old / With falt'ring speech and visage incomposed / Answer'd."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7794b733-ee3b-4825-9f55-95de64123a34",
                                "sense_id": "87e9961c-cc21-3bb2-b496-867ba14c1c8a",
                                "text": "1830, George Gordon Byron, Thomas Moore (editor), poem fragment, Letters and Journals of Lord Byron: With Notices of His Life, Volume 1, page 302,\nOne rank'd in some recording page / With the worst anarchs of the age, / Him wilt thou know — and, knowing, pause,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "047845a3-dad0-4c7a-95ec-37f7124de319",
                                "sense_id": "87e9961c-cc21-3bb2-b496-867ba14c1c8a",
                                "text": "Every genuine boy is a rebel and an anarch. If he were allowed to develop according to his own instincts, his own inclinations, society would undergo such a radical transformation as to make the adult revolutionary cower and cringe."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "110f6e54-2c69-4bbe-aeef-252ac7cecb4f",
                                "sense_id": "87e9961c-cc21-3bb2-b496-867ba14c1c8a",
                                "text": "As all the world knows, Emma Goldman is the chief anarch of her time."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a3956243-e0ff-487f-8244-55b3186f86ca",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b328a00-7936-322d-8f4a-7d8f26a933da",
